---
title:    "High-Level Server Side Web Scripting in Curry"
citation: "(PADL 2001)"
url:      "http://www.informatik.uni-kiel.de/~mh/papers/PADL01.html"
date:     2001-01-01 # used for sorting, most recent first, should usually match the papers date
---
This paper describes the design of a library for programming dynamic web pages
in Curry based on standard CGI features.
Due to the use of the functional and logic features of Curry,
details and frequent errors in standard CGI programming are avoided
by an abstraction layer which also supports event handlers,
state variables and interaction sequences.